# DDR 3rd Mix (System 573, digital I/O board): power-on with the game cassette, after the install
# (start from ddr3mj-install's NVRAM). No inputs: the flash checksum, the boot check, the warning,
# the intro video, the title, How To Play and a demo song, both with the MP3 music, the rankings.
# Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core with
# MAME, the MP3 sound with it (oracle/audiosync.py).
game ddr3mj

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 9000 quit
